WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.540
The Abyss.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:08.080
In this DLC we're going to have to confront what it is and how little we know about it.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.480
But what do we know?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.220
Well, the Abyss manifests in a multitude of ways

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.080
which is a point acknowledged by the Follower torch.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:23.360
Which says, that some forms of the Abyss manifest as pus within the body.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.040
This manifestation is called "The pus of Man".

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:30.420
But it can also manifest as black flame

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.220
as the impenetrable fires of humanity

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.400
as human desire drawn towards life

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:41.360
or as a tale of human suffering, applied to a blade.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:46.000
So whether it's pus, sorcery, pyromancy or a miracle

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.280
the Abyss always borders on humanity, that's the one constant.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.280
It serves as a more disturbed form of Dark.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.420
A good parallel is how Chaos is simply a more disturbed form of the Flame

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:05.880
and finally, the Abyss is either a part of you,

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.320
or you're fighting against it,

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.660
and in the case of the Followers of Farron, they were the latter.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.660
If your kingdom became infected by the Abyss

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.780
then you could expect the Undead Legion of Farron at your doorstep.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.700
Clearly recognisable by their pointed steel helms.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:27.160
The Legion were a caravan of Undead warriors

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:31.380
who took upon the Legacy left by Artorias the Abysswalker

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:35.560
and vowed to eradicate the Abyss wherever it was found.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:40.380
We've talked about Farron's Undead Legion before, actually in great depth.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:45.780
And back then we thought we knew what type of warriors served in this travelling army:

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.880
There were the Abyss Watchers, who were the elite fighters

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.320
and likely the vanguard taking the front lines

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.840
there were the Acolytes, these sorcerers of the Legion

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:03.060
and there were the Watchdogs, who looked after Farron Keep itself, while the troops went out fighting.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.440
But the final piece of the puzzle and one we didn't know about until now

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.900
bringing up the rear guard of the travelling army

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.920
were the Followers of Farron.

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:18.800
Warriors, who were left behind when Farron and its Watchers fell to ruin.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:23.140
So the role of the Followers was to do just that,

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.480
to follow behind the caravan of roaming Undead

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.380
as Hollows, who hunted their compatriots taken by the Abyss.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:34.420
Once a warrior of Farron fell to the Abyss

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:40.500
the tall, lean Followers quietly appeared in groups to take them down.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.180
They would attack with this technique, that was honed to face men

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:51.040
because those yet to lose their human aspect, of course were the most commonly tainted.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:56.580
So we see this fighting style honed to face men in our fights with them.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:03.040
The Followers fight you as they used to fight their own compatriots, who were infected by the Abyss:

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:10.140
They surround you, the shieldbearers sprint to place their shields in your face, while those behind spit fire.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:14.960
Fire is said to have been effective against the Abyss since ancient times

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:19.540
and it's only natural, that the Followers would have their torches double as a weapon.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:24.420
On a final command the Followers would hurl their spears at the fallen foe

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:28.120
to give the retired warrior this honourable send off.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:32.380
this concept of respecting fallen warriors

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:37.340
it's totally in keeping with the culture of the Legion, that we've come to expect.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:44.760
Look back at their homeland, there's an entire part of the Legion, the Watchdogs, who are devoted to, and I quote:

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:48.100
"Defend the sanctity of sleeping warriors."

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.460
And there are multiple battlegrounds, as well

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:55.360
where there's these respectful scenes of swords thrust into the earth.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.840
Respecting fallen warriors

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.240
it's something that was done for Artorias

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.020
it's something done in their homeland

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:06.020
and it's something performed by the Followers of Farron.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.600
The Follower armor gives us the final line

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.640
which indicates how they ended up Forlorn

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:17.100
and in the Painted world of Ariandel.
I quote:

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:24.580
"Farron and its Watchers fell to ruin, but the Followers survived as a wandering pack of Hollows."

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:31.960
This shows, once more, that Undead can continue to perform tasks, even after they Hollow.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:37.880
They're not completely mindless and I hope we learn more about this if we visit Londor.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.760
So the Followers outlived their fellow Warriors

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:48.200
and instead of being a part of the ruins of Farron Keep they continued wandering.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:56.600
Forlorn, Hollow, they were drawn into the painting, where they quietly rest beside the trees and the wolves.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:01.900
At least until Unkindled Ash comes to kill them all, promising

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:09.140
Fire for Ariandel. Fire for Ariandel.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:15.960
Hey guys, so I run a Patreon page, where I can give people a little bit extra in return for their support,

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.140
and that's things, like:

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:24.420
Having access to videos a little bit early, streams, you can get the art I commission as a wallpaper.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:28.320
Things like that, so if that sounds interesting, check out the Patreon page

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:32.520
it's made all of this possible, really over the last few years.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:37.660
But regardless of that, thank you so much for watching and I'll see you in the next one.

